# Project Rules for Cursor AI

## Communication & Translation Protocol

- **Translation Requirement**: When the user writes a request in Korean, ALWAYS translate it into English first.
- **Display Format**: Start your response with "**English Translation:** [The translated English text]" followed by a newline.
- **Execution**: After displaying the translation, proceed to execute the request based on the English translation.
- **Scope**: This applies to ALL requests in this project.
